@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8090
@staffToken = paste-staff-token-here
@studentToken = paste-student-token-here

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### Register a student
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Ali","studentId":"s100","username":"ali","password":"secret123"}

### Student login: copy token into studentToken above
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"role":"STUDENT","username":"ali","password":"secret123"}

### Librarian login: copy token into staffToken above
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"role":"LIBRARIAN","username":"abc","password":"123456"}

### Public search
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/books?available=true

### Add book
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/books
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"id":"b100","title":"Clean Code","author":"Robert Martin","publishYear":2008}

### Request a loan
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/books/b100/borrow-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"days":7}

### Approve
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/books/b100/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### Confirm collection
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/books/b100/receive
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### My loans
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/loans
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Return
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/books/b100/return
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
